          "cleandoc_equal": true
        },
        {
          "node": "module.body[10]",
          "before": "Exact reachable-policy graph; oracle work is strictly offline reference.\n\nThe NDU value is nested CE, while all other fields are expectations under the\nactual joint kernel. The ideal oracle excludes online computation overhead.\n",
